ns extend trigonometric ratios beyond acute angles; identities such as sin2θ=2sinθcosθ help with multiple-angle questions. Check that the result is plausible for the given angle.\n\n8-mark marking guide: 2 marks for the core concept; 3 marks for accurate principles, steps or formulas; 2 marks for an example/application; 1 mark for a justified conclusion or check. A strong answer should explain the governing concept, justify the chosen method, check the result and acknowledge a relevant limitation."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

